---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout title="Privacy Policy - Playback speed Calculator" description="Privacy policy for Playback speed Calculator. Learn how we handle your information on playback speed calculator.">
  <section class="section-container" style="padding: var(--spacing-3xl) var(--spacing-lg); max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <div style="margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: var(--font-size-body-sm); font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-link);">Privacy Policy</div>
    <h1 style="font-size: var(--font-size-heading-xl); font-weight: var(--font-weight-heading-xl); color: var(--color-ink); margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-lg);">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p style="font-size: var(--font-size-body-md); color: var(--color-body); line-height: var(--line-height-body-md); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);">
      Last updated: November 2026
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: var(--font-size-body-md); color: var(--color-body); line-height: var(--line-height-body-md); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);">
      Playback speed Calculator ("we," "us," or "our") operates the playback speed calculator at realplaybackspeed.com. This page informs you of our policies regarding the collection, use, and disclosure of personal data.
    </p>
    <h2 style="font-size: var(--font-size-heading-md); font-weight: var(--font-weight-heading-md); color: var(--color-ink); margin: var(--spacing-lg) 0 var(--spacing-sm);">Information We Collect</h2>
    <p style="font-size: var(--font-size-body-md); color: var(--color-body); line-height: var(--line-height-body-md); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);">
      Our calculator runs entirely in your browser. We do not collect, store, or share personal data, video files, or YouTube URLs you enter. Duration lookups are made anonymously server-side and no identifiable information is retained. If you contact us via the contact form, we collect the name and email you provide solely to respond to your inquiry.
    </p>
    <h2 style="font-size: var(--font-size-heading-md); font-weight: var(--font-weight-heading-md); color: var(--color-ink); margin: var(--spacing-lg) 0 var(--spacing-sm);">Cookies and Local Storage</h2>
    <p style="font-size: var(--font-size-body-md); color: var(--color-body); line-height: var(--line-height-body-md); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);">
      We use local storage (not cookies) to remember your language, device, and theme preferences in your browser. No tracking or analytics cookies are used, and no personal data is sent to third parties.
    </p>
    <h2 style="font-size: var(--font-size-heading-md); font-weight: var(--font-weight-heading-md); color: var(--color-ink); margin: var(--spacing-lg) 0 var(--spacing-sm);">Third-Party Sites</h2>
    <p style="font-size: var(--font-size-body-md); color: var(--color-body); line-height: var(--line-height-body-md); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);">
      Our site links to YouTube, Spotify, Netflix, TikTok, and Instagram. Those services have their own privacy policies, and we are not responsible for their practices.
    </p>
    <h2 style="font-size: var(--font-size-heading-md); font-weight: var(--font-weight-heading-md); color: var(--color-ink); margin: var(--spacing-lg) 0 var(--spacing-sm);">Your Rights (GDPR)</h2>
    <p style="font-size: var(--font-size-body-md); color: var(--color-body); line-height: var(--line-height-body-md); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);">
      You have the right to access, correct, or delete any personal data we hold about you, and to object to or restrict its processing. To exercise these rights, contact us via our <a href="/contact" style="color: var(--color-link);">contact page</a>.
    </p>
    <h2 style="font-size: var(--font-size-heading-md); font-weight: var(--font-weight-heading-md); color: var(--color-ink); margin: var(--spacing-lg) 0 var(--spacing-sm);">Contact Us</h2>
    <p style="font-size: var(--font-size-body-md); color: var(--color-body); line-height: var(--line-height-body-md); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);">
      If you have questions about this privacy policy, contact us via our <a href="/contact" style="color: var(--color-link);">contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
